{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18585","headline":"酬娄秀才将之淮南见赠之什 · 柳宗元","name":"酬娄秀才将之淮南见赠之什","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"远弃甘幽独，谁云值故人。\n好音怜铩羽，濡沫慰穷鳞。\n困志情惟旧，相知乐更新。\n浪游轻费日，醉舞讵伤春。\n风月欢宁间，星霜分益亲。\n已将名是患，还用道爲邻。\n机事齐飘瓦，嫌猜比拾尘。\n高冠余肯赋，长铗子忘贫。\n晼晚惊移律，睽携忽此辰。\n开颜时不再，绊足去何因。\n海上销魂别，天边吊影身。\n秖应西涧水，寂寞但垂纶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳宗元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18585.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18585","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}